<%# One event = one card. An <a> anchor so it's deep-linkable AND keyboard-    -%>
<%# focusable for free; the URL fragment drives selection (see assets/story.js) -%>
<%# and the fragment IS the event's ref, `<example>:<line>` — the same string   -%>
<%# Jess says out loud, so #episode-8-before:174 needs no lookup.               -%>
<%# All content is pre-escaped in the renderer; structure is fixed here, so a   -%>
<%# card can't emit unbalanced tags. Detail lives in the <template> and is      -%>
<%# cloned into the sidebar on select. link_attr (optional) carries the shared  -%>
<%# tokens assets/story.js uses to highlight the rest of a causal chain (a tool -%>
<%# call + its result, a queue enqueue + its dequeue…); edited_attr (optional)  -%>
<%# marks a summary Jess rewrote by hand, which only the editing UI reacts to;   -%>
<%# beat_attr (optional) marks a card narration stops on — story.js's isBeat.    -%>
<%# ctx_attr (optional, main-thread cards only) carries this card's context-map -%>
<%# numbers — story.js sizes the sidebar's three bar segments from it.          -%>
<%# sub_ctx_attr (optional, nested cards only) is the same shape but scoped to  -%>
<%# the owning subagent's own economy — story.js's subagent bar reads it.       -%>
<%#                                                                            -%>
<%# Every comment line here ends with a DASH before the closing delimiter, on   -%>
<%# purpose: otherwise ERB emits the line's newline, and this file renders once -%>
<%# per event — so each undashed comment adds a blank line PER CARD to every    -%>
<%# generated page. Never write a closing delimiter inside the comment text     -%>
<%# either (not even in backticks): it ends the tag early and the rest of the   -%>
<%# line lands on the page. That shipped once; test/renderer_test.rb now fails  -%>
<%# if any ERB delimiter reaches the output.                                    -%>
      <a class="card k-<%= css_kind %>" id="<%= anchor %>" href="#<%= anchor %>" data-time="<%= data_time %>"<%= link_attr %><%= edited_attr %><%= beat_attr %><%= ctx_attr %><%= sub_ctx_attr %>>
        <div class="gutter">
          <span class="kind deco"><%= kind_html %></span>
          <span class="who"><%= who %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="summary"><%= summary_html %></div>
          <%= badges_html %>
        </div>
        <template class="detail"><%= detail_html %></template>
      </a>
